  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-LhVCA0WA\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-TcGcL7b2\">使用场景</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-nfjH874F\">代理商场景会会关注账户预算情况，当账户消耗达到预算的某一阈值时进行报警</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-RkK8j5Og\" id=\"h346b9f0-oCnP0gWk\">解决思路</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-5GDkjSfS\">通过创建一个定时的监控脚本，监控代理商账户下所有adv账户预算和消耗情况，若账户资金满足某个条件（如 消耗/预算 &gt; 80%），则向企业IM群（如飞书群）发送通知</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E4%B8%8B%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E9%A2%84%E7%AE%97%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%B0%E9%A2%84%E7%AE%97%E7%9A%84%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%80%E9%98%88%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%20%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%2F%E9%A2%84%E7%AE%97%20%3E%2080%25%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E5%90%91%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9AIM%E7%BE%A4%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E7%BE%A4%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%5Cn%20*%2F%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%200.%20%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%5Cnconst%20CONFIG%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BE%9D%E7%85%A7%20https%3A%2F%2Fopen.feishu.cn%2Fdocument%2Fclient-docs%2Fbot-v3%2Fadd-custom-bot%20%E5%9C%A8%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E7%BE%A4%E7%BB%84%E4%B8%AD%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%20webhook%20%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%A1%AB%E8%87%B3%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%5Cn%20%20webHookURL%3A%20''%2C%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%2F%E9%A2%84%E7%AE%97%E9%98%88%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%2080%25%5Cn%20%20threshold%3A%2080%2C%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%5Cnexport%20async%20function%20mai